n__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Unfortunately I haven't found it officially hosted anywhere now that OPP's taken over. Just PDFs that people share back and forth. But I think it would be reasonable for the WoD Codex to host it now, since it was released for free.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a shame. Hopefully someone can gather all the errata for 1e and upload it somewhere, or at least OPP or WW can host it again. I know 1e is not the current edition, but that's no excuse. I can still get errata for D&amp;D 3.0, not just 3.5 if I wanted to. And omg, that WoD Codex is amazing! I like your idea, they would be a perfect fit to host 1e errata. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> *gets lost going through WoD Codex*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25251-soullos","name":"soullos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}